---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Wrapper from "@/components/fundations/containers/Wrapper.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  pageTitle="Apply for a One-Week Business Build — Raleigh AI Guy"
  pageDescription="You do not need to know the exact opportunity. Share a little about your business and Danny will help uncover the best problem to solve on your first call."
>
  <section>
    <Wrapper variant="wide" class="py-14 sm:py-20 lg:py-24">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <p class="field-label flex items-center gap-2"><span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--brand-orange)]" aria-hidden="true"></span>One-week build application</p>
          <h1 class="font-editorial mt-6 text-5xl font-medium leading-[.92] tracking-[-.045em] sm:text-7xl">You bring the business. We’ll find the problem together.</h1>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-base leading-7 text-base-600">You do not need an AI idea, a technical plan, or even a perfectly defined pain point. Tell me what feels harder than it should. On the call, I’ll ask questions and help uncover the opportunity with the strongest potential return.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--brand-orange)] pl-5">
            <p class="font-semibold">If you qualify</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-base-600">On our first call, we choose one focused opportunity. Then I take on the initial risk and build a working proof of value in one week. You invest in the full system only after you see what it can save or earn.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="font-utility mt-8 text-[.62rem] uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-base-500">No assessment fee · No build fee · No obligation</p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-black/15 pt-7 lg:col-span-7">
          <form name="one-week-build" method="POST" action="/thank-you/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="website">
            <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="one-week-build" />
            <p class="hidden"><label>Do not fill this out: <input name="website" /></label></p>

            <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
              <label class="intake-label">Name<input class="intake-field" type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name" required /></label>
              <label class="intake-label">Work email<input class="intake-field" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@company.com" required /></label>
              <label class="intake-label sm:col-span-2">Company<input class="intake-field" type="text" name="company" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Business name" required /></label>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-7 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
              <label class="intake-label">How many people work in the business?
                <select class="intake-field" name="team_size" required>
                  <option value="" selected disabled>Choose a range</option>
                  <option>Just me</option><option>2–5</option><option>6–15</option><option>16–50</option><option>51+</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label class="intake-label">Approximate annual revenue
                <select class="intake-field" name="revenue" required>
                  <option value="" selected disabled>Choose a range</option>
                  <option>Under $250k</option><option>$250k–$1m</option><option>$1m–$5m</option><option>$5m–$10m</option><option>$10m+</option><option>Prefer not to say</option>
                </select>
              </label>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-7 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
              <label class="intake-label">Where do you feel the most friction?
                <select class="intake-field" name="friction" required>
                  <option value="" selected disabled>Choose the closest fit</option>
                  <option>Repetitive admin and busywork</option><option>Sales, leads, and follow-up</option><option>Customer service and communication</option><option>Marketing and content</option><option>Scheduling, handoffs, and operations</option><option>Reporting and finding information</option><option>I’m not sure yet</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label class="intake-label">How much time could better systems give back?
                <select class="intake-field" name="hours_saved" required>
                  <option value="" selected disabled>A rough estimate is fine</option>
                  <option>Under 5 hours per week</option><option>5–10 hours per week</option><option>10–20 hours per week</option><option>20+ hours per week</option><option>I don’t know yet</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label class="intake-label sm:col-span-2">If I show you clear time or money savings, are you ready to invest monthly?
                <select class="intake-field" name="readiness" required>
                  <option value="" selected disabled>Choose the honest answer</option>
                  <option>Yes — I’m ready now</option><option>Yes — within the next 3 months</option><option>Possibly — it depends on the value</option><option>No — I’m only exploring</option>
                </select>
              </label>
            </div>

            <label class="intake-label mt-7">Anything you want me to know? <span class="font-normal text-base-400">(optional)</span>
              <textarea class="intake-field min-h-24 resize-y" name="context" rows="3" maxlength="800" placeholder="Share a specific frustration or goal if you have one. It is completely fine to leave this blank."></textarea>
            </label>

            <div class="mt-7 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
              <button type="submit" class="site-cta">See if my business qualifies →</button>
              <p class="text-xs leading-5 text-base-400">I review every application myself. No sales sequence.</p>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Wrapper>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
